{"title":"Cabbage Seeds","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Hill Giant Behemoth, Hill Giant Brute, Frost Giant, Frost Giant Brute</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"frost-giant-brute\" title=\"Frost Giant Brute - dropped it in 1 of 5 looted corpses (1/5)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/95f26613ce70e2599fc1.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Frost Giant Brute</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/5<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"hill-giant-behemoth\" title=\"Hill Giant Behemoth - dropped it in 3 of 16 looted corpses (1/5)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/9c1502dd610dfce57688.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Hill Giant Behemoth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/5<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"frost-giant\" title=\"Frost Giant - dropped it in 1 of 6 looted corpses (1/6)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/43020762332ab1de1a27.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Frost Giant</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/6<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"hill-giant-brute\" title=\"Hill Giant Brute - dropped it in 1 of 10 looted corpses (1/10)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/e9a36278b57ead590991.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Hill Giant Brute</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/10<br>×2</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div